{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1353024000, "end_date": 1353628799, "month_true_total": 32, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:46:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "2241398", "author": {"steamid": "76561198004514572", "personaname": "Guy man Hyp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sswejh/", "num_games_owned": 620, "num_reviews": 152, "playtime_forever": 1520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 436, "last_played": 1641576163, "avatar": "66662b0f7f869d8d0e058f20aeab1b4e0bb0fb32"}, "language": "english", "review": "This Thirdperson hack N slash-shooter get better each time i play it. And now when i actually dived into the 40k lore, this game ascends to a whole other level. \nThis game is a must for any 40k fan. \nSpaceMarine 2 in the making so hyped up!! (please dont let me down?:')  ) \nRemeber though, no heresy preordering, the inquisition gonna get you!. \n\n\n\n(OLD REV) \nGreat game, one of the titles that really got me hooked on Warhammer 40k, sadly this is one of a kind talking Warhammer 40k games. \n\nSure, turnbased is fun and all,but eh. \nBut this, this is the game where you really feel like all hell break loose and action is around every corner. Save the turnbased stuff for the tabletop and get me more thirdperson action shooters like these. \n\ncan i please have SpaceMarine 2?? :(\n\n\n\nFinished 2012-11-20\nFinished 2021-12-19", "timestamp_created": 1353413445, "timestamp_updated": 1654702390, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "3124301", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017840999", "personaname": "doriath", "persona_s